# Equip worthy (CR 702.6a, 700.16): a creature is worthy if it is legendary, not a Villain, and red and/or white. Bot1 equips
# Magda, Brazen Outlaw (red only) on turn 3, then moves it to Belladonna Took (white only) on turn 5: each colour on its own is
# enough. Refused, each beside those positive controls: Batroc the Leaper (legendary and red, but a Villain), turn 5; Bilbo, Thief
# in the Night (legendary, not a Villain, but blue), turn 7; and Giver of Runes (white, but not legendary), turn 9. Mjölnir's own
# enters trigger is given no target (up to one).

